abstract: >-
  Events, places, heritage sites, rulers, relics and schematic boundaries of Sri Lankan history from the
  Palaeolithic to the present, each linked to typed evidence and a bibliography, with chronicle references
  verified against public-domain translations. Entries marked "draft" await expert review.
